Foundations PL4 — Minecraft 1.21.1 / NeoForge 21.1.250

Original Practical Logistics and Sonar Core were created by Ollie Lansdell
(SonarSonic). Their MIT license notice is preserved in LICENSE and
LICENSE-SonarCore. Upstream resources retain their original attribution.

Foundations PL4 is an independent development adaptation. Runtime code is
contained in the net.foundations.pl4 namespace and is installed as one JAR.
It does not load a separate Sonar Core mod, MCMultiPart mod, Foundations
Framework mod, or Calculator mod. This does not mean the unfinished original
features or every historical Sonar Core API have been ported.

The Sonar Core source was retrieved and audited as a reference. Its relevant
recipe behavior has been adapted to Minecraft 1.21.1 recipe registries,
serializers, item tags and recipe synchronization within Foundations PL4.
See docs/CORE_INTEGRATION.md for exact coverage and remaining work.
